---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import {reassessContent as c} from '../data/reassess-content';
import {phone,url} from '../data/site';
import hero from '../assets/reassess-family-review-20261015.png';
import social from '../assets/reassess-social-20261015.png';
import '../styles/reassess.css';
const canonical=url(c.path),link=(p:string)=>p.startsWith('#')?p:url(p);
const graph=[{'@type':'DefinedTerm','@id':canonical+'#module',name:'Reassess, Review and Repeat',description:c.direct,url:canonical,isPartOf:{'@id':url('/pinnacleai')+'#software'},subjectOf:c.sources.map(s=>url(s.href))}];
---
<PageLayout path={c.path} label="Reassess, Review and Repeat" title={c.title} description={c.description} shareImage={social} shareVersion="2026-10-15-reassess" imageAlt="Every next step deserves a reason. Reassess, Review, Repeat. PinnacleAI. Call 9100 181 181." imageCaption="Pinnacle Blooms Network · Reassess, Review and Repeat illustrated creative" includeService={false} primaryEntityId={canonical+'#module'} entityGraph={graph} citations={c.sources.map(s=>url(s.href))} faqs={c.faqs} publishedOn="2026-09-30" updatedOn={c.updatedOn} breadcrumbParent={{name:'PinnacleAI®',path:'/pinnacleai'}}>
<article class="reassess-page">
 <section class="rr-wrap rr-hero" aria-labelledby="rr-title">
  <div><p class="rr-kicker"><Icon name="loop" size={23}/>PinnacleAI® · Reassess · Review · Repeat</p><h1 id="rr-title">Your child’s next step<br/><em>deserves a reason.</em></h1><p class="rr-lead">{c.lead}</p><div class="rr-actions"><a class="rr-button rr-primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="pinnacleai-call"><Icon name="phone"/>Call {phone.display}</a><a class="rr-button" href={url('/enroll-autism-speech-aba-therapies-india')} data-cta="final-enquiry">Begin with Pinnacle <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div><p class="rr-purpose">{c.purpose}</p><a class="rr-text-link" href={url('/centers')}><Icon name="pin" size={20}/>Find a Pinnacle centre →</a></div>
  <figure class="rr-hero-art"><Image src={hero} widths={[480,800,1200,1536]} sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 46vw, (min-width: 700px) 650px, 100vw" format="webp" quality={81} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" alt="Illustration of a family reviewing school-bag picture cues with a Pinnacle therapist, linking supported practice at home and school."/><figcaption>One child. Everyday observations. A next step your family understands.</figcaption></figure>
 </section>
 <nav class="rr-wrap rr-jump" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#what-review-does">Why review matters</a><a href="#worked-example">Follow one decision</a><a href="#next-review">Your family’s role</a><a href="#seven-stages">The whole journey</a><a href="#sources">Sources &amp; citations</a><a href="#questions">Questions</a></nav>
 <section class="rr-section rr-soft" id="what-review-does"><div class="rr-wrap rr-definition"><div><p class="rr-kicker">Understand the change. Shape the next step.</p><h2>A plan is a route.<br/><em>Your child’s life gives it direction.</em></h2><p>{c.direct}</p><a class="rr-text-link" href={url(c.sources[0].href)}>See the documented review cycle →</a></div><aside class="rr-promise"><Icon name="compass" size={38}/><h3>Leave with clarity.</h3><ul><li>What became easier in everyday life?</li><li>What still needs support?</li><li>Why are we keeping or changing the plan?</li><li>What will the next review decide?</li></ul><p>A home takes more than bricks. Each ability and therapy contribution needs a purpose in the life your child is growing toward.</p></aside></div></section>
 <section class="rr-section" id="worked-example"><div class="rr-wrap"><div class="rr-heading"><p class="rr-kicker">One family priority. A complete review loop.</p><h2>{c.example.title}</h2><p>{c.example.intro}</p></div><p class="rr-scan"><Icon name="plan" size={28}/><span><strong>The decision:</strong> keep the useful picture sequence; try one supported step in a quieter school-arrival setting; review what the child actually does and how it feels.</span></p><div class="rr-observations">{c.example.observations.map(o=><article><p class="rr-kicker"><Icon name={o.icon} size={25}/>{o.label}</p><h3>{o.title}</h3><dl><dt>Setting</dt><dd>{o.setting}</dd><dt>Support</dt><dd>{o.support}</dd><dt>Observation</dt><dd>{o.response}</dd></dl><p class="rr-meaning">{o.meaning}</p></article>)}</div><p class="rr-comparison"><Icon name="track" size={31}/>{c.example.comparison}</p><div class="rr-decision"><p class="rr-kicker">The professional and family agree the adjustment</p><h3>Keep what helps. Change the arrival.</h3><p>{c.example.decision}</p><a href={url('/best-occupational-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate')}>How occupational therapy supports everyday routines →</a></div><div class="rr-checkpoint"><p class="rr-kicker"><Icon name="clock" size={23}/>The next checkpoint</p><h3>What did the agreed support make possible?</h3><p>{c.example.checkpoint}</p></div><div class="rr-branches">{c.example.branches.map(b=><article><Icon name={b.icon} size={29}/><h3>{b.title}</h3><p>{b.text}</p></article>)}</div><p class="rr-note">This example explains the review mechanism. <a href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html')}>The documented source trail distinguishes a proposed review from an observed later result →</a></p></div></section>
 <section class="rr-section rr-soft" id="review-cycle"><div class="rr-wrap"><div class="rr-heading"><p class="rr-kicker">How PinnacleAI® supports the decision</p><h2>Measure. Listen. Decide.<br/><em>Return to life and check again.</em></h2><p>A new score opens a discussion. A useful review explains what changes in the child’s plan.</p></div><ol class="rr-loop">{c.loop.map((step,i)=><li><span class="rr-number">{i+1}</span><Icon name={step.icon} size={30}/><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.text}</p><a href={link(step.href)}>Explore this part →</a></li>)}</ol><div class="rr-system-links"><a href={url('/seven-readiness-indexes')}>Seven Readiness Indexes →</a><a href={url('/therapeuticai')}>TherapeuticAI® activity support →</a><a href={url('/pinnacleai')}>The complete PinnacleAI® system →</a></div></div></section>
 <section class="rr-section" id="next-review"><div class="rr-wrap rr-family"><div><p class="rr-kicker">You know the moments that matter</p><h2>Your family helps shape<br/><em>what happens next.</em></h2><p>{c.example.family}</p><p>You do not need a perfect diary. One clear everyday example can make the next conversation more useful.</p><a class="rr-text-link" href={url('/everyday-therapy')}>Bring suitable practice into everyday life →</a></div><aside><h3>Bring these five things.</h3><ul>{c.familyChecklist.map(item=><li><Icon name="check" size={20}/><span>{item}</span></li>)}</ul><p class="rr-note">Share observations and relevant reports through the agreed private care channel. Ask the team how school input can be included with permission.</p></aside></div></section>
 <section class="rr-section rr-soft" id="seven-stages"><div class="rr-wrap"><div class="rr-heading"><p class="rr-kicker">Every therapy matters. Your child’s life gives it purpose.</p><h2>One direction.<br/><em>Seven connected stages.</em></h2><p>Reassessment returns the learning to the plan. Growing independence, school readiness and participation remain the direction throughout.</p></div><ol class="rr-stages">{c.stages.map((s,i)=><li><a href={link(s.href)}><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><Icon name={s.icon} size={25}/><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.text}</p></a></li>)}</ol><div class="rr-therapies">{c.therapies.map(t=><a href={url(t.href)}><h3>{t.name} →</h3><p>{t.text}</p></a>)}</div><p class="rr-note">Professional contributions follow the child’s needs. The plan does not require every child to receive every therapy.</p><a class="rr-text-link" href={url('/mainstream')}>Explore meaningful mainstream participation →</a></div></section>
 <section class="rr-section" id="sources"><div class="rr-wrap"><div class="rr-heading"><p class="rr-kicker"><Icon name="shield" size={23}/>Open the record behind the explanation</p><h2>A clear purpose.<br/><em>Sources you can inspect.</em></h2><p>Read the workflow, research status and licensed software scope in Pinnacle Verify.</p></div><div class="rr-sources">{c.sources.map(s=><article><h3><a href={url(s.href)}>{s.title} ↗</a></h3><p>{s.text}</p><p class="rr-note">{s.scope}</p></article>)}</div><div class="rr-cite" id="cite"><Icon name="book" size={30}/><div><h3>Cite or share this explanation.</h3><p>Bharath Healthcare Laboratories Private Limited. (2026-10-15). <em>Reassess, Review and Repeat: child development progress review.</em> Pinnacle Blooms Network. <a href={canonical}>{canonical}</a></p><div class="rr-system-links"><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/reassess-review-repeat-sources.json">Source map · JSON</a><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/reassess-review-repeat-sources.txt">Plain text</a><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/reassess-review-repeat-reading.md">Reader · Markdown</a><a href={'https://wa.me/?text='+encodeURIComponent('Every next step deserves a reason. See PinnacleAI Reassess, Review and Repeat: '+canonical)} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Share on WhatsApp ↗</a></div><p class="rr-note">Page reviewed <time datetime={c.updatedOn}>15 October 2026</time>. This date records the page/source review, not a new clinical study or issuer verification.</p></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="rr-section rr-soft" id="questions"><div class="rr-wrap"><div class="rr-heading"><p class="rr-kicker">Useful answers before you begin</p><h2>Your questions.<br/><em>A clearer next conversation.</em></h2></div><div class="rr-faq">{c.faqs.map(f=><details><summary>{f.question}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{f.answer}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
 <section class="rr-section rr-final" id="next-step"><div class="rr-wrap"><p class="rr-kicker">Begin with the life you want your child to grow toward</p><h2>Bring one everyday priority.<br/><em>Let’s make the next step clear.</em></h2><p>Tell us what you want your child to take part in more comfortably. Ask how an assessment, professional support and a review plan can help your family begin with clarity.</p><div class="rr-actions"><a class="rr-button rr-primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="final-call"><Icon name="phone"/>Call {phone.display}</a><a class="rr-button" href={url('/enroll-autism-speech-aba-therapies-india')} data-cta="final-enquiry">Start our family’s conversation <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div><p><a href={url('/centers')}>Choose a Pinnacle centre →</a></p><p class="rr-note">The team confirms the suitable professional, visit, fees and review arrangements with you.</p></div></section>
</article>
</PageLayout>
